    <string name="privacy_policy_text">Privacy Policy for Micro Journal\n\nLast updated: May 2026\n\n1. Data Storage\nAll journal entries are stored locally on your device. We do not upload your personal writings to any server.\n\n2. Data Collection\nMicro Journal does not collect personal information, analytics, or usage tracking.\n\n3. Backups\nWhen you export a backup, you choose where to share or save the file. We have no access to exported data.\n\n4. Permissions\nThe app does not require internet, location, camera, or contacts permissions.\n\n5. Children\nThis app is suitable for general audiences. Parental guidance is recommended for users under 13.\n\n6. Contact\nFor privacy questions, contact the developer through the Play Store listing.\n\n7. Changes\nWe may update this policy. Continued use of the app means you accept the updated policy.</string>
